<title>USA: Milwaukee, Wis., won by Hutchinson, Shockey.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee, Wis., won by Hutchinson, Shockey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson, Shockey, Erley &amp; Co said it won $10.7705 million of Milwaukee, Wis., general obligation short-term promissory notes, Series B7, with a true interest cost of 4.151 percent.</p>
</text>
